@title Pin names: the Issues list offers to rename unusual pins to the class names (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# The fixture has a motor with pins U V W and a relay coil with pin a1. Check > Issues lists two "Pin names" rows (info). Right-clicking the motor row offers "Rename 3 pins to the usual names"; after it that row is gone, and one undo brings it back.
open qa/fixtures/pin-names.kopercad
wait 30
click_text "2 warnings"
wait 20
expect "is not usual"
shot issues-listed
click 180 305 right
wait 10
shot row-menu
expect "usual names"
click_text "Rename 3 pins to the usual names"
wait 20
shot after-rename
expect_not "U, V, W is not usual"
expect "a1 is not usual"
key ctrl+z
wait 20
shot after-undo
expect "U, V, W is not usual"
check_layout
